{"pageid":4921,"title":"Dogwood blossom","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Dogwood blossom</span>","revid":21120,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The Dogwood Blossom is a flower found on the <a href=\"/wiki/Dogwood\" title=\"Dogwood\">dogwood</a> tree. The flower is similar to the <a href=\"/wiki/Sakura_Blossom\" title=\"Sakura Blossom\">Sakura Blossom</a>'s flower, just like the tree is. The flower sells for 75 in raw, and 300$ jarred. The flower has nothing special to it, eccept blending in the tree. </p><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b0/Jarred_dogwood_blossom.png/revision/latest?cb=20260307233405\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Jarred\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b0/Jarred_dogwood_blossom.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20260307233405\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"247\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Jarred dogwood blossom.png\" data-image-key=\"Jarred_dogwood_blossom.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Jarred_dogwood_blossom.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Jarred</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure> <figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d7/Dogwood_blossom.png/revision/latest?cb=20260307233431\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Raw flower\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d7/Dogwood_blossom.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20260307233431\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"175\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Dogwoo